  "releaseNotes": "Add opt-in FilterMapper.AddMapForNaturalSortKey. Distinct-values queries use ColumnDistinctValueQueryModel , which now inherits GridifyQueryModel for standard Page/PageSize offset paging. ColumnDistinctValuesAsync orders keyed columns by their natural sort key using (value, key) distinct, and orders the no-search path deterministically by value.",
